# Keep the recommender corpus and the dev tooling out of the deploy upload.
#
# The leading slashes matter and their absence broke a build. These patterns
# follow gitignore rules, where a bare `data/` matches a directory of that
# name at ANY depth — so it silently took `src/data/` with it, and the app
# could not resolve vrTours.json. Anchored to the repo root, it means only
# the top-level directories.
/data/
/scripts/
